WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.212
One operator generates everything.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.741
Inside the factor, take a well-understood hyperfinite piece

3
00:00:05.741 --> 00:00:08.314
P, then add a generic unitary u.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.592
Together they generate everything; P needs one

5
00:00:11.592 --> 00:00:13.899
generator, and two combine into one.

6
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.287
Claimed: every such factor is singly generated.

7
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.259
Lean-checked main theorem.
